### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### MCP ping
GET http://localhost:8080/mcp
X-API-Key: changeme
Content-Type: application/json

### MCP tool call — list_repos (stub)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
X-API-Key: changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_repos",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "personal"
    }
  }
}

### MCP tool call — get_pipeline_status (stub)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
X-API-Key: changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get_pipeline_status",
    "arguments": {
      "account": "personal",
